38
00:04:26,043 --> 00:04:31,084
[Host] Hegemann and Nagel found a protein inside algae that reacts to light.

39
00:04:31,684 --> 00:04:34,012
[Vocab] 反応

40
00:04:34,411 --> 00:04:36,283
[Host] It means a reaction.

41
00:04:36,884 --> 00:04:47,372
