42
00:04:48,172 --> 00:04:53,475
[Host] Professor Deisseroth developed a way to put this protein into nerve cells in the brain.

43
00:04:54,076 --> 00:04:56,524
[Vocab] 開発

44
00:04:56,923 --> 00:04:58,795
[Host] It means development.

45
00:04:59,396 --> 00:05:08,564
[Slow] 光を当てると、神経細胞のスイッチを入れたり切ったりすることができます。

46
00:05:09,363 --> 00:05:13,540
[Host] When you shine light on them, you can switch nerve cells on and off.

47
00:05:14,139 --> 00:05:16,276
