48
00:05:16,675 --> 00:05:19,244
[Host] Here it means to shine light on something.

49
00:05:19,843 --> 00:05:29,995
[Slow] この技術によって、特定の神経の働きと行動の関係が分かるようになりました。

50
00:05:30,795 --> 00:05:36,579
[Host] Thanks to this technique, scientists can now see how certain nerves are linked to behavior.

51
